          "short": "$y>\\frac{9}{4}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}9-4y&<0\\\\-4y&<-9\\\\y&>\\frac{9}{4}\\end{align*}$$\nDividing by $-4$ reverses the inequality sign.",
